     "en": "The Last Lonely Person",
     "zh_CN": "The Last Lonely Person"
    },
    "body": {
     "en": "Dear, Unknown,\nI met a man in a diner last night.\nHe was sitting alone by the window,\nwatching the yellow cabs pass by.\nWe talked until they started closing.\nBefore I left, I asked why he came there every night.\nHe said,\n“So I don't have to be alone.”\nI thought that was strange.\nHe was alone the whole time.\n— M",
