   "letter": {
    "theme": "kindness",
    "title": {
     "en": "The Last Postcard",
     "zh_CN": "The Last Postcard"
    },
    "body": {
     "en": "Dear, Unknown,\nLondon has been grey for days.\nThe sky never seems to change.\nEven the afternoons feel like evenings.\nI haven't heard from you in a long time.\nI used to think you were busy.\nThen I thought maybe you didn't want to write back.\nToday, I don't feel like guessing anymore.\nSo I think this will be the last postcard I send you.\nI hope you're well.\n— M",
     "zh_CN": "Dear, Unknown,\nLondon has been grey for days.\nThe sky never seems to change.\nEven the afternoons feel like evenings.\nI haven't heard from you in a long time.\nI used to think you were busy.\nThen I thought maybe you didn't want to write back.\nToday, I don't feel like guessing anymore.\nSo I think this will be the last postcard I send you.\nI hope you're well.\n— M"
    }
